"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for Amper, with one line descriptions.
"Amper.class" Amper main Java program compiled byte code
"amper.exe" JET executable Converts & to &amp in html, and back
"amper.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"amper.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Amper project
"amper.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Amper project
"amper.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Amper project
"amper.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Amper project
"amper.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Amper project
"amper.jar" jarred class files: Converts & to &amp in html, and back
"Amper.java" Converts & to &amp; in html
"amper.look" uncommented jar manifest
"amper.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Amper project
"amper.use" precis(summary) Converts & to &amp in html, and back Generated
"amper.xml" ASP PAD desc of the Amper project: Converts & to &amp in html, and back
"amper20.zip" Amper 2.0 distribute zip: Converts & to &amp in html, and back
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for Amper
"DeAmpify.class" alternate Java program compiled byte code
"deampify.exe" JET executable
"deampify.jar" jarred class files.
"DeAmpify.java" converts &amp; to & in html
"deampify.look" uncommented jar manifest
"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in amper20.zip
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"j18.txt" marker to indicate that Java compiler target version 1.8 needed.
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Amper project files
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for Amper
"run.bat" execute the Amper application from the jar
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"use.txt" key facts about the Amper project. Generates amper.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the Amper project. Generates amper.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the Amper project. Generates amper.use
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for amper20.zip
